---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Sam Witty">
  <main class="home">
    <h1>Sam Witty</h1>

    <p>
      Sam Witty is a senior research scientist at <a href="https://www.tri.global">Toyota Research Institute</a>, where
      he works on AI technology for reliable science and engineering. His work combines modern LLM-based agents with
      formal systems for probabilistic and causal reasoning, drawing on ideas from programming languages, epistemology, and statistics.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that, Sam founded Sorbus, an AI consultancy for hard tech R&amp;D teams. Earlier, he was a senior research scientist at <a href="https://basis.ai">Basis</a> and
      a core developer on the <a href="https://basisresearch.github.io/chirho/getting_started.html">ChiRho</a> causal probabilistic
      programming language. He completed his PhD at UMass Amherst and was a visiting researcher at MIT.
    </p>
    <p class="links">
      <span>samawitty [at] gmail.com</span>
      <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=EUGPPvQAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;sortby=pubdate">Google Scholar</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .home {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 1rem 6rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
</style>
